      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Easy to make when you feel rough, and soothing to eat: warm, simple, few ingredients." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fácil de hacer cuando te sientes mal y reconfortante: caliente, sencillo, pocos ingredientes."
